body:
Hi {{customer_name}},

Hope you’re well. Our records show invoice {{invoice_id}} for £{{amount}} fell due on {{due_date}} ({{days_overdue}} days ago). Could you confirm payment timing?

If paid, please ignore this note. Otherwise, a quick reply with your expected date would be appreciated.

Thanks,
{{sender_name}}
Finance | {{company_name}}

Hi {{customer_name}},

We’re following up again on invoice {{invoice_id}} (amount £{{amount}}), overdue since {{due_date}}. Please advise payment date within 48 hours.

Regards,
{{sender_name}}
Finance | {{company_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

This is an urgent reminder for invoice {{invoice_id}} totalling £{{amount}}. It is now {{days_overdue}} days past due. We have attached a statement and will escalate if unresolved by {{escalation_date}}.

Please confirm payment today.

Regards,
{{sender_name}}
Finance | {{company_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

Despite prior reminders, invoice {{invoice_id}} for £{{amount}} remains unpaid ({{days_overdue}} days overdue). Unless settled or disputed in writing within 5 business days, we will proceed with next steps.

Finance contact: {{sender_name}} | {{sender_email}}

Regards,
{{sender_name}}
Finance | {{company_name}}
